CC       protein from infected cells. {ECO:0000250|UniProtKB:P17763}.
CC   -!- PTM: [Serine protease/helicase NS3]: Acetylated by host KAT5.
CC       Acetylation modulates NS3 RNA-binding and unwinding activities and
CC       plays an important positive role for viral replication.
CC       {ECO:0000250|UniProtKB:Q32ZE1}.
CC   -!- PTM: [RNA-directed RNA polymerase/Methyltransferase NS5]:
