CC       {ECO:0000250|UniProtKB:P17763}. Note=Located in RE-derived vesicles
CC       hosting the replication complex. {ECO:0000250|UniProtKB:Q9Q6P4}.
CC   -!- SUBCELLULAR LOCATION: [Non-structural protein 2A]: Host endoplasmic
