CC       {ECO:0000250|UniProtKB:P06935}. Host cytoplasm, host perinuclear region
CC       {ECO:0000250|UniProtKB:P06935}.
CC   -!- SUBCELLULAR LOCATION: [Peptide pr]: Secreted
