CC   -!- SUBCELLULAR LOCATION: [RNA-directed RNA polymerase/Methyltransferase
CC       NS5]: Host endoplasmic reticulum membrane; Peripheral membrane protein;
CC       Cytoplasmic side. Host nucleus {ECO:0000250|UniProtKB:P06935}.
